<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay's senate approves Yacyreta dam sale.</title>
<headline>Paraguay's senate approves Yacyreta dam sale.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's senate Thursday approved the privatization of the Yacyreta hydro-electric dam on the Argentine-Paraguayan border.</p>
<p>The senate approved a protocol signed by the two countries to sell off the concession for the dam for 30 years.</p>
<p>The sale still has to be approved by the chamber of deputies, which is expected to give final approval to the move before year's end.</p>
<p>Argentina's President Carlos Menem has said that he wanted at least one chamber of Paraguay's Congress to approve the sale before Argentina moves to authorize the privatization.</p>
<p>((-Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom 595 21 444527))</p>
